        <mxCell id="fLXnm-_tEq3v2q1kqu8M-8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;FOO Services Overview (Extracted VERBATIM)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Background&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Absa PPB Operations has embarked on an AI-enabled business transformation journey focused on improving customer outcomes, increasing operational effectiveness and accelerating the delivery of business value through the responsible application of Artificial Intelligence and Agentic AI capabilities. The H2 2026 portfolio represents the next phase of this journey and builds on the foundations established through previous AI initiatives and strategic investments across PPB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The broader PPB H2 AI portfolio comprises prioritised value streams across Customer Experience and Fraud. While each value stream addresses a distinct business challenge, they share common data, technology, governance and delivery requirements. As a result, the portfolio is being delivered through a shared AI platform, common engineering foundations, reusable agent patterns and an integrated programme delivery model.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The PPB OPS AI workstream forms part of the broader PPB H2 AI portfolio and focuses on improving customer servicing operations through the application of data, analytics, AI-enabled insights and targeted automation capabilities across Customer Experience and Fraud domains.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(128, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;H2 Delivery Ambition&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The objective of the PPB H2 AI portfolio is to establish a &lt;b&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(128, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;shared AI platform&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt; and deliver a prioritised set of AI-enabled business capabilities that validate business value, data readiness, architecture patterns and operational adoption through iterative delivery. The portfolio will leverage &lt;b&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(128, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;common platform services&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(128, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;reusable components&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, shared architecture patterns and coordinated governance structures to accelerate delivery and reduce duplication across PPB value streams.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The H2 portfolio is focused on delivering targeted business capabilities and measurable outcomes within defined scope boundaries. &lt;b&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(128, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;Enterprise-wide business transformation&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, AI operating model design, enterprise AI governance implementation, formal enterprise change management and organisation redesign activities are excluded unless separately agreed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(128, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;PPB OPS AI Workstream Ambition&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The PPB OPS AI workstream will establish intelligence and automation capabilities that improve visibility into operational customer servicing performance, reduce manual effort within selected operational processes and provide fact-based recommendations for future transformation initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The workstream combines customer intelligence, operational insight generation, targeted automation and capability validation across Customer Experience and Fraud domains.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="940" width="1190" x="530" y="-1130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
